WEBVTT

00:01:47.975 --> 00:01:49.272
Baki!

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.497
Orochi Doppo.

00:02:00.521 --> 00:02:04.534
You've done well to train this far,
to build up this far...

00:02:04.558 --> 00:02:08.586
| bestow upon you my highest praise!

00:02:13.067 --> 00:02:15.845
What... is that...?

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:21.808
"God of War, God of Death”

00:02:22.076 --> 00:02:26.389
How do I even describe this?!

00:02:26.413 --> 00:02:31.061
His unusually-developed hitting muscles
form an image of flesh!

00:02:31.085 --> 00:02:34.130
Is this the Ogre's true form?!

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:37.701
The usually-curious crowd
is now speechless...!

00:02:37.725 --> 00:02:39.591
He's a monster...!

00:02:40.427 --> 00:02:44.441
| could see you almost
in tears from that corner.

00:02:44.465 --> 00:02:45.875
Strydom-san...

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:50.980
Must've been quite a shock.
That's the demon's true form.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.335
Demon...

00:02:54.808 --> 00:03:00.457
On all his battlefields, he refused
to use weapons, not even knives.

00:03:00.481 --> 00:03:03.960
He turned his body into a weapon
during those horrible times...

00:03:03.984 --> 00:03:10.934
But he grew used to those horrors.
No... They even satisfied him.

00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:14.037
When the techniques
he honed for self-defense

00:03:14.061 --> 00:03:18.108
became a weapon for seeking out battles,

00:03:18.132 --> 00:03:25.482
a demon- an ogre- settled into his back.

00:03:25.506 --> 00:03:27.684
You, of anyone, should know

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:32.055
that those are not unnatural muscles
created by barbell training.

00:03:32.079 --> 00:03:35.792
Those are the results
of constant accumulation

00:03:35.816 --> 00:03:38.114
and refinement through Grappling!

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:03.773
His blocks aren't working at all!

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:15.198
As rich as the history of karate may be,

00:04:15.222 --> 00:04:18.701
it was still created
for use against people.

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:23.540
Once Yujiro is serious,
he's no longer human...

00:04:23.564 --> 00:04:26.609
Damn...! His karate isn't working!

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:28.431
Doppo...

00:05:20.821 --> 00:05:23.381
His special double-nukite...!

00:05:40.574 --> 00:05:46.823
Even with its perfect feints,
the ancient double-nukite technique

00:05:46.847 --> 00:05:50.393
has just been outdone
by the demon's reflexes!

00:05:50.417 --> 00:05:56.049
Has there ever been a match
as epic as this...?!

00:06:03.096 --> 00:06:05.308
Sir!

00:06:05.332 --> 00:06:08.097
No more...!

00:06:10.504 --> 00:06:12.370
The match is--

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:30.433
--He's getting back up!
--Orochi still wants to fight!

00:06:30.457 --> 00:06:33.069
Doppo...! Stay down...!

00:06:33.093 --> 00:06:33.525
Doppo...! Stay down...!

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:41.811
Complete fractures:

00:06:41.835 --> 00:06:45.381
1in my right pinky, 2 in my
right forearm, 1 in my left forearm,

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:50.987
I in my feft upper arm, 2 left ribs,
I in my lower jawbone...

00:06:51.011 --> 00:06:52.956
Incomplete fractures:

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:56.626
1in my right forearm, 2 in my
left upper arm, 1 in each thigh...

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:59.128
8 lacerations, 26 contusions,

00:06:59.152 --> 00:07:02.765
cerebral hemorrhaging
and ruptured eardrums...!

00:07:02.789 --> 00:07:05.568
As if that could stop me!

00:07:05.592 --> 00:07:11.507
The fearsome Orochi Doppo
has gotten back up!

00:07:11.531 --> 00:07:13.124
Don't do it!

00:07:14.201 --> 00:07:17.280
You're going to let me continue?

00:07:17.304 --> 00:07:18.931
I appreciate it!

00:07:30.183 --> 00:07:32.117
Doppo!

00:07:42.129 --> 00:07:44.564
There it is! The demon!

00:07:47.067 --> 00:07:49.312
The demon...

00:07:49.336 --> 00:07:53.034
It's crying...!

00:08:00.347 --> 00:08:04.181
To think I would ever use this...

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.549
Baki. That is Yujiro.

00:08:26.573 --> 00:08:31.320
He hits as hard as he can
with those demon-given muscles...

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:36.025
That's all that technique is,
but its speed, timing, and destructiveness

00:08:36.049 --> 00:08:39.262
are beyond human comprehension.
In short...

00:08:39.286 --> 00:08:41.482
---there's no defense!

00:08:57.003 --> 00:08:59.549
Where are you going?!

00:08:59.573 --> 00:09:04.287
Exiting the ring during a match
will be deemed as forfeiture!

00:09:04.311 --> 00:09:05.621
He's dead.

00:09:05.645 --> 00:09:07.557
Eh?!

00:09:07.581 --> 00:09:10.226
What?!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.185
D- Doppo...!

00:09:25.799 --> 00:09:26.960
Doppo!

00:09:28.235 --> 00:09:31.296
Doppo...!

00:09:33.273 --> 00:09:35.351
The match is over!

00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:40.089
What are you doing?! Get this
war god to the medical room!

00:09:40.113 --> 00:09:43.276
Quit loafing around!

00:09:54.828 --> 00:09:55.818
"Medical Room"

00:09:58.732 --> 00:10:00.427
Doppo...

00:10:01.902 --> 00:10:04.837
<i>--Please stand back.
- sorry...</i>

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:09.152
Doctor, everything's set.

00:10:09.176 --> 00:10:11.804
--And the saline?
--1200cc.

00:10:13.947 --> 00:10:16.626
Doctor! Can't you do anything?!

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:20.329
His pupils, pulse, it's all bad!
We need to resuscitate!

00:10:20.353 --> 00:10:22.287
It's a fight against time!

00:10:24.858 --> 00:10:27.904
--Does he have a pulse?!
--No.

00:10:27.928 --> 00:10:31.174
--How about now?!
--No pulse.

00:10:31.198 --> 00:10:35.294
--How about now?!
--This... kind of fight...

00:10:45.512 --> 00:10:46.722
No pulse.

00:10:46.746 --> 00:10:50.011
Come on! Start beating!

00:10:50.917 --> 00:10:53.396
Beat! Beat!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.464
Champion. Are you coming?

00:10:55.488 --> 00:10:57.867
You nitwit! Stay out!

00:10:57.891 --> 00:11:01.704
I'm sorry! It's almost time,
so please get ready...

00:11:01.728 --> 00:11:03.423
No pulse...

00:11:10.203 --> 00:11:12.171
B- Baki...?!

00:11:13.173 --> 00:11:17.269
--That is no longer Baki.
--Eh?

00:11:18.411 --> 00:11:20.277
Dammit!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.682
Doctor...?

00:11:27.254 --> 00:11:29.432
Doppo...!

00:11:29.456 --> 00:11:30.967
Damn it...!

00:11:30.991 --> 00:11:32.535
Pardon me.

00:11:32.559 --> 00:11:34.003
It's you...!

00:11:34.027 --> 00:11:37.395
I'm told a man has been laid waste to.

00:11:39.666 --> 00:11:41.410
Shinogi Kureha...!

00:11:41.434 --> 00:11:44.335
Might I have a look at him, too?

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.431
Shinogi Kureha...!

00:12:02.455 --> 00:12:05.481
Might I have a look at him, too?

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:09.438
What are you doing here?!

00:12:09.462 --> 00:12:11.507
--Get the hell out!
-- Stop!

00:12:11.531 --> 00:12:12.875
But...!

00:12:12.899 --> 00:12:15.911
Doctor. I assume you know who I am?

00:12:15.935 --> 00:12:17.980
Of course...!

00:12:18.004 --> 00:12:22.051
You appear troubled.
Allow me to mend this patient.

00:12:22.075 --> 00:12:26.455
No doctor in the country
would refuse your help!

00:12:26.479 --> 00:12:28.243
You're too kind.

00:12:32.485 --> 00:12:40.085
Allow me to give you fighters
a lecture on the human body today.

00:12:41.261 --> 00:12:45.741
- I need setting pins.
--Setting pins?

00:12:45.765 --> 00:12:47.130
Thank you.

00:12:48.168 --> 00:12:52.648
All things have reasons,
the body being no exception.

00:12:52.672 --> 00:12:56.419
By simply knowing those reasons,
it would not be difficult at all

00:12:56.443 --> 00:13:04.443
to instantly destroy a well-trained body
-or to revive a destroyed one.

00:13:05.885 --> 00:13:08.130
Anesthesia complete.

00:13:08.154 --> 00:13:09.918
Just like that...?

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:19.442
Wha...?!

00:13:19.466 --> 00:13:22.244
What?! You're directly
massaging his heart?!

00:13:22.268 --> 00:13:23.713
Yes.

00:13:23.737 --> 00:13:26.349
If fully acquainted with the human body,

00:13:26.373 --> 00:13:31.402
one can easily control the heart
without damaging the skin.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:49.739
He has a pulse!

00:13:49.763 --> 00:13:51.891
Doppo...!

00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:57.179
I've revived him enough
to breathe on his own.

00:13:57.203 --> 00:13:59.248
I leave the rest to you, Doctor.

00:13:59.272 --> 00:14:02.207
Alright! Get him to the hospital!

00:14:09.549 --> 00:14:14.196
It seems you were making
quite a fuss over living and dying,

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:18.467
but to we doctors, life and death
is an everyday experience

00:14:18.491 --> 00:14:20.823
and nothing to get worked up about.

00:14:22.162 --> 00:14:25.141
You look a little pale, Champion.

00:14:25.165 --> 00:14:28.177
Is this your first time
seeing life and death?

00:14:28.201 --> 00:14:31.113
It appears the shock of
witnessing an acquaintance's death

00:14:31.137 --> 00:14:34.083
has put your circulatory organs
into a slight state of panic.

00:14:34.107 --> 00:14:37.787
Are you going to be all right?

00:14:37.811 --> 00:14:43.993
You're about to fight the most
perfect body in history, you know.

00:14:44.017 --> 00:14:47.180
Well, may the best man win.

00:14:48.021 --> 00:14:51.321
| must return to my warm-up now.

00:14:52.859 --> 00:14:57.339
That was my resuscitation lecture.
My one on destruction is next.

00:14:57.363 --> 00:14:59.957
| hope you look forward to it.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.947
Shinogi Kureha...
He's no laughing matter.

00:15:04.971 --> 00:15:06.148
Huh?

00:15:06.172 --> 00:15:11.253
His level of anatomical knowledge
is far greater than any fighter's.

00:15:11.277 --> 00:15:16.772
As such, his techniques for
bodily destruction are daunting...

00:15:19.352 --> 00:15:21.446
I don't stand a chance...!

00:15:29.829 --> 00:15:32.775
The world's strongest martial artist...

00:15:32.799 --> 00:15:37.480
Defeated by the
world's strongest being...!

00:15:37.504 --> 00:15:39.768
Doppo...

00:15:40.974 --> 00:15:43.853
This just in...

00:15:43.877 --> 00:15:47.623
Incredible! Orochi Doppo has
miraculously escaped death

00:15:47.647 --> 00:15:50.726
and was just rushed to the hospital!

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:51.994
That's our Tiger Killer!

00:15:52.018 --> 00:15:57.433
"Indestructible” is the
only way to describe him!

00:15:57.457 --> 00:16:00.736
And now for today's main event,

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:05.875
the champion, Hanma Baki,
versus Shinogi Kureha!

00:16:05.899 --> 00:16:09.512
Oh! Shinogi has made a quick entrance!

00:16:09.536 --> 00:16:13.983
He's really sweating! Is he planning
to get straight to the point?!

00:16:14.007 --> 00:16:20.572
It seems he's avenging his brother Kosho,
who lost to the champion!

00:16:23.917 --> 00:16:27.530
What's this?
Shinogi is holding a water pillow!

00:16:27.554 --> 00:16:31.333
It appears he's going to give
some sort of demonstration!

00:16:31.357 --> 00:16:33.469
Are you going to kill him, Brother?!

00:16:33.493 --> 00:16:35.086
"Byakko Locker Room"

00:16:35.562 --> 00:16:40.709
His body's condition
is of no concern to me.

00:16:40.733 --> 00:16:43.646
Even if I end the match in 10 seconds,

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:47.265
it will be the greatest and
quickest destruction tragedy ever.

00:17:00.353 --> 00:17:05.154
The crowd is stirred by Shinogi's
incredible breathing capacity!

00:17:06.059 --> 00:17:09.939
If there is one thing I can't stand...

00:17:09.963 --> 00:17:14.243
---it's the conceit
of those martial artists!

00:17:14.267 --> 00:17:21.731
The conceit that only they can be
experts on bodily destruction...!

00:17:25.044 --> 00:17:30.813
I'll show them who the real experts are,
fighters or doctors...

00:17:31.918 --> 00:17:36.583
Now he has a tire!
What exactly is he planning to do?!

00:17:58.077 --> 00:18:00.155
Incredible!

00:18:00.179 --> 00:18:02.291
He's like a jack!

00:18:02.315 --> 00:18:04.960
This looks to be one amazing match!

00:18:04.984 --> 00:18:07.885
Oh! The champion's already in the ring!

00:18:10.456 --> 00:18:13.369
That moron! He's still shabby-lookin'!

00:18:13.393 --> 00:18:15.537
They're already glaring at each other!

00:18:15.561 --> 00:18:18.574
But the champion is
completely expressionless

00:18:18.598 --> 00:18:21.076
towards the highly-confident Shinogi!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:25.581
After seeing that demonstration
after Orochi Doppo"s defeat,

00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:28.233
has the champion grown hesitant too?!

00:18:30.009 --> 00:18:32.755
It appears he hasn't warmed up...

00:18:32.779 --> 00:18:37.059
Your muscles are as cold as ice.

00:18:37.083 --> 00:18:40.763
How do you expect
to fight in this condition?

00:18:40.787 --> 00:18:47.002
Champion. There's no time.
At least start warming up now...

00:18:47.026 --> 00:18:48.404
Yes?

00:18:48.428 --> 00:18:50.089
He's still not ready...?!

00:18:51.397 --> 00:18:52.875
Hanma Baki-san...

00:18:52.899 --> 00:18:59.915
Please forgive us for intruding
just before your match begins...

00:18:59.939 --> 00:19:05.287
There is something we must tell you
before you go out there.

00:19:05.311 --> 00:19:07.541
About Dr. Shinogi...

00:19:11.317 --> 00:19:14.430
Aside from the use of weapons,
everything goes!

00:19:14.454 --> 00:19:19.301
Coming out here without
any sweat is an insult to me.

00:19:19.325 --> 00:19:22.538
Do you take me for an amateur?

00:19:22.562 --> 00:19:26.842
As I said earlier,
today I shall teach you Grapplers

00:19:26.866 --> 00:19:31.599
just how inexperienced you are
when it comes to the human body.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:42.558
Baki! You idiot!
You didn't even warm up...2!

00:19:42.582 --> 00:19:47.329
You're scorching hot! How is that--

00:19:47.353 --> 00:19:50.365
Could you stop talking?

00:19:50.389 --> 00:19:53.535
| am Shinogi Kureha's...

00:19:53.559 --> 00:19:54.958
---victim.

00:19:56.162 --> 00:20:01.276
I'm not the only one.
There are many others just like me.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:04.270
I'm here as their representative.

00:20:06.005 --> 00:20:08.884
Shinogi is an unlicensed doctor.

00:20:08.908 --> 00:20:14.957
But specialists secretly say how he's
"the most skilled in the world".

00:20:14.981 --> 00:20:19.228
We were all told our injuries
and diseases were untreatable,

00:20:19.252 --> 00:20:22.631
so as our last ray of our hope,
we made agreements with him,

00:20:22.655 --> 00:20:26.635
paid his exorbitant treatment costs,
and trusted our bodies to him.

00:20:26.659 --> 00:20:32.708
However, after our operations,
our bodies didn't recover one bit.

00:20:32.732 --> 00:20:36.912
Naturally, we asked him
to explain himself.

00:20:36.936 --> 00:20:40.549
But he said this:

00:20:40.573 --> 00:20:45.921
My surgery is far ahead of
present medical standards,

00:20:45.945 --> 00:20:48.423
but is not immediately effective.

00:20:48.447 --> 00:20:51.693
You'll just need to be patient.

00:20:51.717 --> 00:20:56.799
Afterwards, after thorough investigation,
we learned something.

00:20:56.823 --> 00:21:02.171
He knew the operations he did on us
hadn't yet been proven effective.

00:21:02.195 --> 00:21:05.707
In other words,
it was all armchair theory!

00:21:05.731 --> 00:21:09.878
He had used our bodies
for his trial experiments!

00:21:09.902 --> 00:21:14.283
Just to satisfy his desire
for medical research...!

00:21:14.307 --> 00:21:20.022
We absolutely can't let Shinogi Kureha
get away with this!

00:21:20.046 --> 00:21:23.525
Hanma Baki-san! I beg of you!

00:21:23.549 --> 00:21:26.128
Please make that monster--

00:21:26.152 --> 00:21:27.813
Champ...

00:21:35.761 --> 00:21:39.675
--Will Baki be all right?
--Probably.

00:21:39.699 --> 00:21:42.978
Let's get this match underway!

00:21:43.002 --> 00:21:44.401
Begin!

00:21:58.184 --> 00:22:01.763
The champion unleashes
a surprise attack!

00:22:01.787 --> 00:22:04.600
You're gonna pay for what you've done!

00:22:04.624 --> 00:22:07.321
Don't think you can leave unharmed!

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:50.379
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.403 --> 00:22:55.984
hangs onto love
in one corner of the pavement

00:22:56.008 --> 00:23:01.657
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.681 --> 00:23:06.662
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.686 --> 00:23:12.200
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.224 --> 00:23:17.739
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.763 --> 00:23:23.412
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.436 --> 00:23:28.951
but they will be reborn

00:23:28.975 --> 00:23:34.623
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.647 --> 00:23:41.110
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.129 --> 00:23:52.097
"Next Episode”

00:23:56.969 --> 00:23:58.914
The boy is revitalized.

00:23:58.938 --> 00:24:01.683
Silently, he places
his anger into his fists.

00:24:01.707 --> 00:24:05.921
The "Ultra Body" that exploits
its reputation as god of destruction

00:24:05.945 --> 00:24:08.623
begins its cruel lecture.

00:24:08.647 --> 00:24:11.059
Will the undefeated king fall?

00:24:11.083 --> 00:24:13.328
But he's watching.

00:24:13.352 --> 00:24:14.997
The Ogre, once more.

00:24:15.021 --> 00:24:19.959
"Next Episode: The Devil's Payback”
